<title>CENTRAL AFRICAN REPUBLIC: SOCCER-GUINEA BEAT CENTRAL AFRICA IN NATIONS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GUINEA BEAT CENTRAL AFRICA IN NATIONS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BANGUI 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinea beat Central African</p>
<p>Republic 3-2 (halftime 1-1) in an African Nations Cup soccer</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Guinea - Momo Wadder Souma (27th and 79th minute), Mousa</p>
<p>Keita (85th)</p>
<p>Central Africa - Georges Matondo (30th), Alain Azo (48th,</p>
<p>penalty)</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
</text>
